45	    45	 * whatever its lines or rates say, so its amount is the subtotal less the discount (plus any surcharge).
46	    46	 * <p>
47	    47	 * An invoice can carry a minimum charge: when its net total (everything above, worked out as usual) comes
48	    48	 * out under it, the minimum is billed instead, and the invoice records that the minimum was applied.
