181	   181	    /**
182	   182	     * How much one of this invoice's discounts actually takes off the subtotal, to the cent. The
183	   183	     * percentages are taken first, each its share of the subtotal (never more than its cap, if it has
184	   184	     * one), then the flat amounts in the order they were added; none takes off more than is left after
185	   185	     * those before it.
